## Name

La_version


## Alias

La_version


## Title

LAPACK Version


## Description

Report the version of LAPACK in use.


## Usage

```r
La_version()
```

## Value

A character vector of length one.

  Note that this is the version as reported by the library at runtime.
  It may differ from the reference ('') implementation, for
  example by having some optimized or patched routines.  For the version
  included with , the older (not Fortran 90) versions of
  

```

    DLARTG DLASSQ ZLARTG ZLASSQ
  
```


  are used.


## See Also

[`extSoftVersion`](../extsoftversion/) for versions of other third-party software.

  [`La_library`](../la_library/) for binary/executable file with LAPACK in use.


## Examples

```r
La_version()
```

## Keyword

utilities
